      "normative_level": "SHOULD",
      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "endpoint",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "If the UAS has reason to believe that the scheme of the Request-URI has been improperly modified in transit, the UA SHOULD notify its user of a potential security breach.",
